# Canonical author identity.
#
# Early commits were made under a placeholder git identity and an unedited
# template email, neither of which routes to a real account. History is
# deliberately not rewritten — the commit messages are this project's design
# record and their hashes are cited elsewhere. This file maps the old
# identities onto the canonical one so git log, git shortlog and blame report
# a single author.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email>  Old Name <old@email>

GodSpeed313 <lamontb778@gmail.com>  Continuum Core <continuum-core@hessian.local>
GodSpeed313 <lamontb778@gmail.com>  Kevin Brown <your-github-email@example.com>
